                                "sense_id": "6ca2107f-de4f-33dd-b911-ebf7c7187dd7",
                                "text": "Today, the world is seeing record-shattering storms in California and catastrophic drought in places like East Africa. But by the 2030s, as temperatures rise, climate hazards are expected to increase all over the globe as different countries face more crippling heat waves, worsening coastal flooding and crop failures, the report says."
